unistr('<li><code>C005</code>: <strong>Sub\00E1rea da cidade</strong></li>'),
unistr('<li><code>C006</code>: <strong>Regi\00E3o (Estado)</strong></li>'),
unistr('<li><code>C007</code>: <strong>Pa\00EDs</strong></li>'),
unistr('<li><code>C011</code>: <strong>Vetor de Correspond\00EAncia</strong></li>'),
'<li><code>N001</code>: <strong>Longitude</strong></li>',
'<li><code>N002</code>: <strong>Latitude</strong></li>',
unistr('<li><code>D001</code>: <strong>Timestamp da Geocodifica\00E7\00E3o</strong></li>'),
'</ul>',
unistr('<p>Use a seguinte consulta para extrair da coleta os resultados da geocodifica\00E7\00E3o:</p>'),
'',
'<pre>',
'select c001 as street,',
'       c002 as house_number,',
'       c003 as postal_code,',
'       c004 as city,',
'       c005 as city_sub_area,',
'       c006 as region,',
'       c007 as country,',
'       c011 as match_vector,',
'       n001 as longitude,',
'       n002 as latitude,',
'       d001 as geocode_date',
'  from apex_collections',
' em que collection_name = ''{nome da coleta}''',
'</pre>',
unistr('<p>Se a coleta n\00E3o existir, ela ser\00E1 criada antes da adi\00E7\00E3o do primeiro membro. As coletas existentes <em>n\00E3o</em> ser\00E3o limpas; isso dever\00E1 ser feito usando outro processo de p\00E1gina que \00E9 executado antes desse processo de geocodifica\00E7\00E3o.</p>')))
);
end;
